<title>PHILIPPINES: Universal Robina sees higher net.</title>
<headline>Universal Robina sees higher net.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Robina Corp expects its net income for the financial year ending September 30 to reach 1.4 billion pesos, company president James Go told reporters on Thursday.</p>
<p>Net income was 1.29 billion pesos the previous year.</p>
</text>
